Nice point!  All I can do is point to the aspect markers as indicative.  Of=
 course there are other tricks: intransitive eating per se is an activity, =
transitive eating is a process.  For a person whose jaw has been wired shut=
 for weeks, ordinary eating may be an achievement.  And, of course, being a=
n eater is a state.  But I don't know what the clues are in Lojban.

